# Personal Blog (Flask)

A full-featured personal blogging platform built with **Flask** and **SQLAlchemy**. It supports user authentication, post management with Markdown, categories, tags, comments with replies, RSS feed, image uploads, and a responsive UI.

## Features

- 📝 **Blog Posts** — Create, edit, delete, and publish posts with Markdown support and featured images
- 🏷️ **Categories & Tags** — Organize posts by category and tag
- 👤 **Authentication** — Register, login, logout, profile management, and public author profiles
- 💬 **Comments** — Comment on posts with threaded replies and admin moderation
- 🔎 **Search** — Search posts by title and content
- 📡 **RSS Feed** — Auto-generated RSS 2.0 feed of latest posts
- 📈 **Analytics** — Track post views, active users, and blog statistics
- 🖼️ **Image Uploads** — Secure image handling with allowed extensions and unique file names
- 🎨 **Responsive UI** — Clean, mobile-friendly design with custom CSS and JavaScript
- 🛡️ **Security** — Password hashing, CSRF protection via Flask-WTF, access control for admin-only features

## Tech Stack

- **Backend:** Python, Flask 3.0
- **Database:** SQLAlchemy (defaults to SQLite)
- **Auth:** Flask-Login
- **Forms:** Flask-WTF / WTForms
- **Frontend:** HTML5, CSS3, JavaScript (Jinja2 templates)
- **Other:** Werkzeug, python-dotenv, email-validator

