## Database Models

| Model    | Description                                    |
| -------- | ---------------------------------------------- |
| `User`   | Blog users with username, email, profile, admin flag |
| `Category` | Post categories                              |
| `Tag`    | Post tags (many-to-many with posts)            |
| `Post`   | Blog posts with title, content, slug, image, views |
| `Comment`| Comments and threaded replies on posts         |

The database tables are created automatically on app startup via `db.create_all()`.

## Routes Overview

### Main
| Route          | Method       | Description                  |
| -------------- | ------------ | ---------------------------- |
| `/`            | GET          | Home page with posts, search, stats |
| `/about`       | GET          | About page                   |
| `/contact`     | GET, POST    | Contact form                 |
| `/newsletter`  | POST         | Newsletter subscription      |
| `/rss`         | GET          | RSS feed                     |

### Auth
| Route               | Method       | Description                    |
| ------------------- | ------------ | ------------------------------ |
| `/register`         | GET, POST    | Create a new account           |
| `/login`            | GET, POST    | Log in                         |
| `/logout`           | GET          | Log out (requires login)       |
| `/profile`          | GET, POST    | Edit profile (requires login)  |
| `/user/<username>`  | GET          | View a public author profile   |

### Posts
| Route                | Method       | Description                              |
| -------------------- | ------------ | ---------------------------------------- |
| `/post/new`          | GET, POST    | Create a post (requires login)           |
| `/post/<slug>`       | GET          | View a post and increment views          |
| `/post/<slug>/edit`  | GET, POST    | Edit a post (owner/admin)                |
| `/post/<slug>/delete`| POST         | Delete a post (owner/admin)              |
| `/category/new`      | GET, POST    | Create a category (admin)                |
| `/category/<name>`   | GET          | View posts in a category                 |

### Comments
| Route                                | Method | Description                          |
| ------------------------------------ | ------ | ------------------------------------ |
| `/post/<slug>/comment`               | POST   | Add a comment (requires login)       |
| `/post/<slug>/comment/<id>/reply`    | POST   | Reply to a comment (requires login)  |
| `/comment/<id>/delete`               | POST   | Delete a comment (owner/admin)       |
| `/comment/<id>/approve`              | POST   | Approve a comment (admin)            |

